  {
   "parameters": {
    "content": "## Instant inquiry reply\nA web-form or lead-portal inquiry posts to this webhook. The flow cleans the data, ignores spam, checks for a repeat inquiry, emails the lead a short personal-sounding reply with your phone and booking link, logs the lead in your Leads sheet and alerts you by email (SMS optional).\n\n**Setup**\n1. Copy the Production URL of the Webhook node into the sending app (POST JSON).\n2. Open the Config node and fill in your values; connect the credentials shown on each node.\n3. Activate the workflow.",
    "height": 300,
    "width": 420
   },
